enchilada: display: sweetfb_fit and, with a good 0250 verdict, sweetzc on by default

Every daily command line carried sweetzc=1 sweetfb_fit=1. sweetfb_fit now defaults to 1 in both
AppleCLCD and SweetHID (the touch mapping has to agree with the picture), and sweetzc defaults to 1
when 0250's probe says in-place scanout is possible with the scaler (splash pipe and its CTL found,
MDP SMMU bypass, VIG pipe with QSEED3 v1.2/1.3, mixer border on) and fit is on; otherwise it stays
off. One line says which default was taken when sweetzc is not given. Overrides: sweetzc=0 (copy
path), sweetzc=1/2 as before, sweetfb_fit=0 (centred crop; then sweetzc defaults to 0).

